WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:05,590
It should be here

2
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,080
Yellow sand sky

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,040
Lian Shu Dou Ku's plum leaves

4
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,520
This place is deserted enough

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:11,840
I've had enough trouble

6
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:17,450
Probably a newcomer

7
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:19,940
It must be, otherwise who would want to be alone

8
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:21,260
Come to this place where birds don't poop

9
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:22,700
What should we do?

10
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,820
Is there nothing anyone can do to call someone?

11
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:32,020
No need to call

12
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,460
Since you are a newcomer

13
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,540
Let’s teach him the rules of being a newcomer first.

14
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:38,220
It also saves him from having to adapt later.

15
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,620
If we call them, it might not be our turn.

16
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:48,940
Who is coming?

17
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:52,350
Recruits come to enlist Recruits

18
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,630
Our Huangsha Town Camp

19
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:56,110
No new recruits have come for many years.

20
00:00:56,390 --> 00:00:57,990
You're not lying to us, are you?
